[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 22022.47, "timestamp": "06:07:02", "text": "对于 Discord 和类似两个作为备用或"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22025.868, "timestamp": "06:07:05", "text": "以防万一有人喜欢"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22028.15, "timestamp": "06:07:08", "text": "以防万一。有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22030.47, "timestamp": "06:07:10", "text": "Discord 对 Discord 本身并没有什么特别之处，但"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22032.31, "timestamp": "06:07:12", "text": "不过我只是想你知道的，咣当"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22039.31, "timestamp": "06:07:19", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22041.67, "timestamp": "06:07:21", "text": "呃，是哪场比赛？这是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22044.708, "timestamp": "06:07:24", "text": "升级。这是某件事。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22047.548, "timestamp": "06:07:27", "text": "那场比赛将会是这样的："}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22050.548, "timestamp": "06:07:30", "text": "正确的？不，我没有制作Zuki mod。她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22052.35, "timestamp": "06:07:32", "text": "不适用。她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22057.67, "timestamp": "06:07:37", "text": "呃，她祖基以前更早，但她"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22060.07, "timestamp": "06:07:40", "text": "我不想再当版主了，所以我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22062.788, "timestamp": "06:07:42", "text": "版主因为她忙于自己的事情而退出了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 22065.31, "timestamp": "06:07:45", "text": "一切。"}]